WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.559
Part five: Chip Chat and the tool bar. At the bottom right of every screen: Chip Chat, screen capture, screen recording, voice typing, Notes and Issues. It folds away sideways or upwards with the arrow.

2
00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:40.591
Chip Chat is the firm's own expert on call. It knows more than ten thousand questions - how SimplyFile works, tax with real numbers, due dates, kinds of return, roles and permissions - and it answers from SimplyFile's own rules and your firm's own data, for your role. No AI guesswork, and no data leaving the firm.

3
00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:49.862
Under the ask box, a fresh set of example questions every time - some from your own work - and a new hint in the box.

4
00:00:50.468 --> 00:01:01.918
Which returns are overdue? Worked out live from the firm's clients - each line opens the client. And after every answer: what to ask next.

5
00:01:02.531 --> 00:01:07.141
Where does a client stand? Just name them.

6
00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:19.680
Tax questions with numbers are worked out by the same rules as the computation: eighteen and a half lakh for an HUF, old regime, 2025-26.

7
00:01:20.296 --> 00:01:27.736
Twelve lakh for a resident individual in the new regime: the 87A rebate takes the tax to nil.

8
00:01:28.343 --> 00:01:38.953
Due dates for any form and year, and what a return filed on a given day would be: ITR 3 on the 15th of November 2026 is belated.

9
00:01:39.561 --> 00:01:48.661
An updated return, two lakh of extra tax, fifteen months after the year ended: 140 B adds fifty percent.

10
00:01:49.281 --> 00:01:56.651
Who may do what: a tax preparer cannot sign off - and Chip Chat says how it can be lent to him.

11
00:01:57.264 --> 00:02:04.394
And Surprise me: a good question, different for each person, every hour and every press.

12
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:12.919
When Chip Chat does not know, it says so and keeps the question - the firm and the role, never the person's name.

13
00:02:13.514 --> 00:02:25.204
The firm admin trains it on the Train tab: every question asked, what Chip Chat said, and a Teach box - point it at the right answer, or write the firm's own.

14
00:02:25.827 --> 00:02:31.777
The firm's own answer to office hours - taught once, for everyone in the firm.

15
00:02:35.718 --> 00:02:39.418
Ask again - and the firm's answer comes.

16
00:02:41.077 --> 00:03:03.257
Notes: private notes for each person, opened from the tool bar - search on the left, the note on the right, with bold, lists, highlight and text colours, pictures pasted or taken with screen capture, and voice notes kept with the words written down. The microphone is on as Notes opens: what you say is typed in.

17
00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:19.854
Issues: anything wrong or missing goes to the portal admin - a header, the details, several pictures and voice notes. Each issue shows its status and the admin's reply, and the flag shows a badge when a reply is waiting.

18
00:03:23.186 --> 00:03:38.616
Screen capture snips part of the screen - to copy, download, keep in a note or report as an issue. Screen recording makes a video for the team. Voice typing writes what you say into the box you are in.

19
00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:52.984
Chip Chat and the tool bar: more than ten thousand questions answered from SimplyFile's own rules and your own data - by firm and by role, and trained by the firm. Thank you for watching.
